{%- case field -%}
{%- when 'group' -%}wellness
{%- when 'wellness' -%}
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Who is it for? <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.who_is_it_for != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.who_is_it_for | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>Someone with greying hair<br> Someone with damaged &amp; brittle hair<br> Combination scalp<br> Someone with dull, limp &amp; lifeless hair</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Ingredients <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.ingredients != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.ingredients | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>Distilled Himalayan Deodhar water, Distilled Plain water, Cold pressed coconut oil, Aloe vera Gel, Areetha, Fresh Hibiscus flowers and leaves, Hibiscus Tea, Hibiscus tea, Areetha, Potassium Sorbate, Vitamin E, Himalayan Deodhar oil, Kamal Nal, Cedar Wood hydrosol, Geranium essential oil, Shea butter, Lavender Hydrosol, Distilled Orange water, Distilled Rose water, Phenoxyethanol (0.35%), Panthenol (0.55%), Geogard, Coco Glucoside, Lauryl Glucoside, Decyl Glucoside, SCI.</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>What is it? <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.what_is_it != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.what_is_it | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>This shampoo combines a 2 in 1 action of reducing greying hair while restoring strength &amp; shine. Made with zero toxic chemicals, it ensures that your shampoo is naturally benefiting your scalp.</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>What makes it different <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.why_it_is_unique != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.why_it_is_unique | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>This shampoo is made in a soap base made with cold pressed oils instead of palm oil, which is commonly used by brands. It has no artificial thickeners or fragrance, and while the consistency is thinner than chemical shampoos, it is more effective in cleansing the hair. It uses Indic ingredients like chamomile &amp; aloevera nourish the hair and retains the natural benefits of these ingredients as it is infused in brass vessels.</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Disclaimer <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.disclaimer != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.disclaimer | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p>A patch test is mandatory. If the product or a natural ingredient irritates your skin, please stop using it immediately. Please consult your naturopath or physician before using these products.</p>{% endif %}</div></details>
{%- endcase -%}
